        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_411_tomimi_1#2"
    },
    {
        "id": 31,
        "raw": "[name=\"Tomimi\"]  Yep, Zumama and Gavial have always been the strongest around here.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Tomimi",
        "content": "Yep, Zumama and Gavial have always been the strongest around here."
    },
    {
        "id": 32,
        "raw": "[name=\"Tomimi\"]  But as far as I know, Zumama has never managed to beat Gavial!",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Tomimi",
        "content": "But as far as I know, Zumama has never managed to beat Gavial!"
    },
    {
        "id": 33,
