        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_187_ccheal_1#3\", name2=\"char_416_zumama_1#2\", focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1#3",
        "name2": "char_416_zumama_1#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 68,
        "raw": "[name=\"Eunectes\"]  You came back, Gavial.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Eunectes",
        "content": "You came back, Gavial."
    },
    {
        "id": 69,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_187_ccheal_1#3\", name2=\"char_416_zumama_1#2\", focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1#3",
        "name2": "char_416_zumama_1#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 70,
        "raw": "[name=\"Gavial\"]  That's right, Tomimi asked me to come back.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Gavial",
        "content": "That's right, Tomimi asked me to come back."
    },
    {
        "id": 71,
        "raw": "[name=\"Gavial\"]  Hm? Hold up. You know Sargonian?",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Gavial",
        "content": "Hm? Hold up. You know Sargonian?"
    },
    {
        "id": 72,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_187_ccheal_1#3\", name2=\"char_416_zumama_1#2\", focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1#3",
        "name2": "char_416_zumama_1#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 73,
        "raw": "[name=\"Eunectes\"]  ...Since you're speaking Sargonian too, I guess this really is what they speak on the outside.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Eunectes",
        "content": "...Since you're speaking Sargonian too, I guess this really is what they speak on the outside."
    },
    {
        "id": 74,
        "raw": "[name=\"Eunectes\"]  I've been studying it for a long time.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Eunectes",
        "content": "I've been studying it for a long time."
    },
    {
        "id": 75,
        "raw": "[name=\"Eunectes\"]  ...I thought you weren't ever going to come back.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Eunectes",
        "content": "...I thought you weren't ever going to come back."
    },
    {
        "id": 76,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_187_ccheal_1#3\", name2=\"char_416_zumama_1#2\", focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1#3",
        "name2": "char_416_zumama_1#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 77,
        "raw": "[name=\"Gavial\"]  Oh, I'll come back. Not right now, but someday. This is my home, after all.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Gavial",
        "content": "Oh, I'll come back. Not right now, but someday. This is my home, after all."
    },
    {
        "id": 78,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_187_ccheal_1#3\", name2=\"char_416_zumama_1#2\", focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1#3",
        "name2": "char_416_zumama_1#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 79,
        "raw": "[name=\"Eunectes\"]  Are you trying to become the Great Chief?",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Eunectes",
        "content": "Are you trying to become the Great Chief?"
    },
    {
        "id": 80,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_187_ccheal_1#3\", name2=\"char_416_zumama_1#2\", focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1#3",
        "name2": "char_416_zumama_1#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 81,
        "raw": "[name=\"Gavial\"]  Nope, I need you for something else, and I was gonna wait till you were done.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Gavial",
        "content": "Nope, I need you for something else, and I was gonna wait till you were done."
    },
    {
        "id": 82,
        "raw": "[name=\"Gavial\"]  I didn't expect to see you get this badass, though. How am I supposed to hold myself back from fighting you?",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Gavial",
        "content": "I didn't expect to see you get this badass, though. How am I supposed to hold myself back from fighting you?"
