        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1#2",
        "name2": "char_416_zumama_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 147,
        "raw": "[name=\"Eunectes\"]  You can do all sorts of things with your fists, so you don't ever think of using anything else.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Eunectes",
        "content": "You can do all sorts of things with your fists, so you don't ever think of using anything else."
    },
    {
        "id": 148,
        "raw": "[name=\"Eunectes\"]  That's what's holding you back, and it's what's holding all of us back.",
